<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz signs two German deals.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz signs two German deals.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export SA signed two contracts worth a total of 2.45 million marks for construction work in Germany, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said work on one of the contracts would be carried out between October 1996 and May 1999 and on the other between October 1996 and July 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier in the month, the company signed three other German contracts worth a total of 2.2 million marks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
